# Kite Weather
#
# A catchy song that is quietly wrong. The hook is four bars you could hum
# after one listen; everything around it is slightly off.
#
#   catchy      a dotted, skipping hook over Dmaj9 F#m7 Gmaj9 Gm6, a steady
#               half-time beat of sampled, crushed drums
#   unsettling  a ghost double of the hook, 35 cents flat and a sixteenth
#               late; the first pass ends on C# over G minor; the bass walks
#               up a tritone into every loop; reversed snare-reverb swells;
#               a ring-modulated clank in no key; and at the end of every
#               loop the tape sags and every voice sags with it
#
#   bars 1-4    pad, a loose music box, one clank, a swell into the beat
#   bars 5-12   beat, bass, the hook twice
#   bars 13-16  the break: a heartbeat kick, the out-of-tune ghost alone
#   bars 17-24  everything, the ghost doubling, the germanium up
#   bars 25-28  the beat falls apart layer by layer; the tape stops
#
# Drums are samples bounced from Patina's own 909 and broken on purpose by
# scripts/kite-weather-kit.py (run it first; it writes renders/kite-kit/).
# 4/4 at 88 bpm; bar n starts at beat 4*(n-1).

bpm 88
gate 0.95
tail 4

automate tape_wow
0.42
automate tape_flutter
0.1
automate tape_age
0.5
automate tape_drive
0.35
automate chorus_mode
2
automate chorus_rate
0.5
automate chorus_depth
0.45
automate chorus_hiss
0.6
automate spring
0.08
automate reverb_wet
0.3
automate reverb_decay
0.8
automate reverb_tone
3000
automate width
1.1
automate comp_in
1
automate comp_threshold
-24
automate comp_ratio
1
automate comp_attack
3
automate comp_release
4
automate comp_makeup
2
automate comp_mix
0.5
# germanium: a little grit, more when everything plays, easing out
automate fuzz
0.1 R:64 0.32:4@smooth R:28 0.15:8@smooth

# --- pad: Kaini, two saws a few cents apart, a chord a bar
track pad vel=0.5 patch=kaini reverb_send=0.3
([D3 F#3 A3 C#4 E4]:4 [F#3 A3 C#4 E4]:4 [G3 B3 D4 F#4 A4]:4 [G3 Bb3 D4 E4]:4)x7
automate pad.attack
0.9
automate pad.release
2
automate pad.osc2_level
0.6
automate pad.detune
11
automate pad.gain
0.25 0.55:16@smooth R:32 0.4:2@smooth R:12 0.55:2@smooth R:32 0.3:16@smooth
automate pad.cutoff
560 R:64 900:8@smooth R:24 480:16@smooth
automate pad.pitch_shift
0 R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:12 -3:4@smooth

# --- bass: Kaini, mono, a sub; walks up a tritone into every loop
track bass vel=0.6 patch=kaini gain=0.85
R:16
(D2:4 F#2:4 G2:4 G1:2 C#2:2)x6
automate bass.mono
1
automate bass.sub
0.45
automate bass.attack
0.02
automate bass.release
0.6
automate bass.cutoff
420
automate bass.glide
0.08
automate bass.pitch_shift
0 R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:12 -3:4@smooth

# --- music box: Bocuma plucks, played by hand
track pluck vel=0.3 len=0.5 patch=bocuma pan=-0.35 reverb_send=0.4
(D3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R F#3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R F#4@0.25 R D4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R E4@0.25 R D4 R Bb3@0.22 R)x4
(D3@0.34 A3 E4@0.3 F#4 C#4@0.3 A3 E4 A3 F#3@0.34 C#4 E4@0.3 A4 E4@0.3 C#4 A3 E4 G3@0.34 D4 F#4@0.3 A4 B3@0.3 D4 A4 F#4 G3@0.34 D4 E4@0.3 Bb3 D4@0.3 E4 G4 D4)x2
(D3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R F#3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R F#4@0.25 R D4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R E4@0.25 R D4 R Bb3@0.22 R)
automate pluck.vel_filter
1.4
automate pluck.pitch_shift
0 R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:12 -3:4@smooth

# --- the hook: Kaini B, mono, sliding
track tune vel=0.55 patch=kaini-b gain=1.8 reverb_send=0.22
>16
A4:0.75 F#4:0.25 A4:0.5 B4:0.5 A4:1 F#4:1 E4:0.75 C#4:0.25 E4:0.5 F#4:0.5 E4:2 D4:0.75 B3:0.25 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 F#4:1 D4:1 Bb3:0.75 D4:0.25 E4:0.5 D4:0.5 C#4:2 A4:0.75 F#4:0.25 A4:0.5 B4:0.5 A4:1 F#4:1 E4:0.75 C#4:0.25 E4:0.5 F#4:0.5 E4:2 D4:0.75 B3:0.25 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 F#4:1 D4:1 Bb3:0.75 D4:0.25 E4:0.5 G4:0.5 F#4:2
R:16
A4:0.75 F#4:0.25 A4:0.5 B4:0.5 A4:1 F#4:1 E4:0.75 C#4:0.25 E4:0.5 F#4:0.5 E4:2 D4:0.75 B3:0.25 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 F#4:1 D4:1 Bb3:0.75 D4:0.25 E4:0.5 D4:0.5 C#4:2 A4:0.75 F#4:0.25 A4:0.5 B4:0.5 A4:1 F#4:1 E4:0.75 C#4:0.25 E4:0.5 F#4:0.5 E4:2 D4:0.75 B3:0.25 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 F#4:1 D4:1 Bb3:0.75 D4:0.25 E4:0.5 G4:0.5 F#4:2
A4:0.75 F#4:0.25 A4:0.5 B4:0.5 A4:2 R:4 D4:0.75 B3:0.25 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 F#4:2@0.4 R:4
automate tune.glide
0.11
automate tune.lfo_rate
4.6
automate tune.lfo_pitch
5
automate tune.pitch_shift
0 R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.55:0.5@smooth 0:0.5@smooth R:12 -3:4@smooth

# --- the ghost: the hook again, 35 cents flat — alone in the break, then a sixteenth behind
track ghost vel=0.5 patch=kaini-b gain=1.1 pan=0.3 reverb_send=0.45
>48
A4:0.75 F#4:0.25 A4:0.5 B4:0.5 A4:1 F#4:1 E4:0.75 C#4:0.25 E4:0.5 F#4:0.5 E4:2 D4:0.75 B3:0.25 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 F#4:1 D4:1 Bb3:0.75 D4:0.25 E4:0.5 D4:0.5 C#4:2
R:0.25
A4:0.75 F#4:0.25 A4:0.5 B4:0.5 A4:1 F#4:1 E4:0.75 C#4:0.25 E4:0.5 F#4:0.5 E4:2 D4:0.75 B3:0.25 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 F#4:1 D4:1 Bb3:0.75 D4:0.25 E4:0.5 D4:0.5 C#4:2 A4:0.75 F#4:0.25 A4:0.5 B4:0.5 A4:1 F#4:1 E4:0.75 C#4:0.25 E4:0.5 F#4:0.5 E4:2 D4:0.75 B3:0.25 D4:0.5 E4:0.5 F#4:1 D4:1 Bb3:0.75 D4:0.25 E4:0.5 G4:0.5 F#4:2
automate ghost.glide
0.2
automate ghost.gain
1.3 R:63 0.7:1@smooth
automate ghost.pitch_shift
-0.35 R:15 -0.9:0.5@smooth -0.35:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.9:0.5@smooth -0.35:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.9:0.5@smooth -0.35:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.9:0.5@smooth -0.35:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.9:0.5@smooth -0.35:0.5@smooth R:15 -0.9:0.5@smooth -0.35:0.5@smooth R:12 -3.35:4@smooth

# --- drums: sampled, broken, and wet
track kick sample=renders/kite-kit/kick.wav root=C3 fixed mode=oneshot gain=0.5 vel=0.9
>16
(C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:0.75 C3:2.5 C3:0.75)x2
(C3:4@0.55)x4
(C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:0.75 C3:2.5 C3:0.75)x2
C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:1.5 C3:2.5 C3:4 C3:4@0.5
automate kick.reverb_send
0.1
track snare sample=renders/kite-kit/snare.wav root=C3 fixed mode=oneshot gain=0.55 vel=0.85
>16
(R:2 C3:2)x8
R:16
(R:2 C3:2)x8
(R:2 C3:2)x2
# dub throws at the ends of the big sections
automate snare.reverb_send
0.45 R:45.9 0.95:0.1@step R:2 0.45:0.1@step R:45.8 0.95:0.1@step R:2 0.45:0.1@step
track swell sample=renders/kite-kit/snare_verb.wav root=C3 fixed reverse mode=oneshot gain=0.7 vel=0.8 reverb_send=0.3
R:13.95 C3:2.05 R:45.95 C3:2.05 R:29.95 C3:2.05
track hats sample=renders/kite-kit/hat.wav root=C3 fixed mode=oneshot bits=8 rate=11025 gain=2 pan=0.25 len=0.25
>16
(C3@0.9 C3@0.45 C3@0.65 C3@0.4)x32
R:16
(C3@0.9 C3@0.45 C3@0.65 C3@0.4)x32
(C3@0.9 C3@0.45 C3@0.65 C3@0.4)x4
automate hats.reverb_send
0.12
track clank sample=renders/kite-kit/clank.wav root=C3 mode=oneshot gain=1.0 pan=0.45 reverb_send=0.6
R:10.5 G2:0.5@0.45 R:38.5 G2:0.5@0.45 R:1.25 F#2:0.5@0.5 R:1.75 G2:0.5@0.45 R:1.75 G2:0.5@0.45 R:1.25 F#2:0.5@0.5 R:1.25 G2:0.5@0.45 R:1.75 G2:0.5@0.45 R:1.75 F#2:0.5@0.5 R:5.25 G2:0.5@0.45 R:7.5 G2:0.5@0.45 R:7.5 F#2:0.5@0.5 R:7.5 G2:0.5@0.45 R:7.5 G2:0.5@0.45
